 r←Test_Input_Callbacks_003(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;globalParms;parms;txt
⍝ Exercise "Input" with on "onKeyPress" callback.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.OnMyKeyPress←{
     n←⍺
     ⎕IO←0 ⋄ ⎕ML←3
     msg←⍵
     key←2⊃msg
     1≠⍴,key:1
     msg[2]←⊂#.APLTreeUtils.Uppercase key
     msg
 }

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 txt←'All input is converted into uppercase by a⋄user-defined OnKeyPress callback'
 defMat⍪←'Label'txt''DT.Label 20 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Text' '' ''DT.Character 20 1 1

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.onKeyPress←'#.TEMP.OnMyKeyPress'
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo

 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form

 n.Text ∆KeyPress'This is mixed text'
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →GoToTidyUp'THIS IS MIXED TEXT'≢n.Text.Text

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
